You expelled me from every Oregon State Parks volunteer program in a letter=
 that named my public comments as the reason. Before you wrote it, you cons=
tructed a psychological account of me; a motive I had explicitly denied, a =
state of mind I had never described;
 and you recorded my testimony as perspective. You did that knowing the ori=
gin of the matter was trivial and that it had not come from me. You had the=
 record. You had my words, and theirs, on tape. You wrote something else. Y=
ou participated in something else.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I have lived with the result for over a year. Not with hurt -- I want to be=
 exact, because you were not, and because every person in your institution =
I have sought accountability from has chosen the weaponization of language =
over plain recognition. I have lived
 with a fabrication about me, published under state letterhead, that I did =
not author and cannot unwrite. You used the authority of your office to rep=
lace what was true about me with something false, and there is no correctio=
n available to me. That is what
 you did. It is not undone by anything in this letter, and it will not be u=
ndone by anything that comes later. No reversal, no finding, and no judgmen=
t undoes the damage of your choice. It is for that reason I have never soug=
ht those outcomes.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I served you with notice of a claim under 42 U.S.C. =A7 1983 in your indivi=
dual capacity. I have thought long and hard about that choice, both before =
and after, and I have reached a decision. I am writing to tell you that I w=
ill not pursue that claim against
 you personally. Not now, not later, not if this matter proceeds against th=
e state, and not if it goes to trial. The claim is available to me. I decli=
ne to bring it.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
This is not forgiveness and it is not a settlement. It releases nothing on =
behalf of the state. It does not diminish what you owe to me, or to the vol=
unteers who came after me, or the ones before me, or to the ones you speak =
with now at the beginning of their
 service. Your responsibility is yours and it is unchanged.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
I am declining the claim for one reason. I know what it is to have someone =
with authority impose a personal cost on a person's life. You imposed that =
on mine. I have decided I will not impose it on yours. That decision is not=
 about you. It is about what I am
 willing to do.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
